                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "How is it possible this crappy game has so many good reviews? \n\nThere is basically no gameplay at all, you just tap your mouse every second and wish your rocket go throught barriers without crash detection... You can't click anytime as it just respond for 1 click every second... \n\nNot worth even for free, stay away from it. Achievements are nearly impossible (or long way to master it without any fun) and as you can see in leaderboards, there are just 2 or so people, who beat 1000 points for the hardest achievements (which is waste of time).\n\nAnd really you don't unlock all achievements even if you beat 1000 points in first try?",
